<h2>Grape Garden Map - Kirby's Adventure and Underwater / Ice Friend Area - Pokemon Mystery Dungeon: Red Rescue Team Mashup</h2>
<audio controls data-chiptune="pmd x kirby 2.nsfe" data-intro-length=10649 data-loops=2 data-fade=10000 data-panning={} style=width:100%></audio>
<p>I was inspired to make this mashup because these two songs already sound very similar.
<p>I could have made this mashup to follow the limitations of either the Famicom or the GBA, but I decided to follow the limitations of the Famicom because that seemed like a more interesting challenge.
<p>This mashup was made using FamiStudio.
<p>I submitted this mashup to SiIvaGunner, and it got uploaded as an <a href=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_FoQY4nh3iM target=_blank>official "SiIvaGunner Rip"</a> on <time datetime="2026-07-27">July 27, 2026</time>.
<p><a href=https://www.mediafire.com/file/9xuqgkky5hz6cia/grape_garden_map_x_friend_area_oceanic_7.zip/file target=_blank>Mediafire download for project file and renders</a>.

